                                "sense_id": "f855332d-5b2a-3f47-84fc-9d8248b42d50",
                                "text": "Lauren loves to zoot around the shopping mall. At top speed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d366f97c-bd73-471a-8807-81ef022ffab5",
                                "sense_id": "f855332d-5b2a-3f47-84fc-9d8248b42d50",
                                "text": "As well as allowing more and more people to zoot around the city in their cars, these roads also allowed for the improvement of public transport within Cardiff."
